Vendored Helm chart
-------------------

charts/crossplane is a vendored copy of the upstream Crossplane cluster
Helm chart (from core/crossplane/cluster/charts/crossplane), with image and
defaults adjusted for this project. The chart ships its own Apache License
2.0 text at charts/crossplane/LICENSE.
